sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Workbench
  participant B as Real browser
  participant Z as ZooGlass
  participant P as Playwright
  W->>B: Launch, register and await page ready
  W->>B: Connect and subscribe to both views
  B->>Z: Open data socket and send subscriptions
  Z-->>B: Subscription acknowledgements
  B-->>W: Actions completed
  Note over W,B: Empty views need no initial snapshot
  W->>Z: Send position 40, then position 42
  Z-->>B: Real view updates
  B-->>W: Receipt observations
  W->>P: Check marker 42 and history [40,42]
  P->>B: Inspect DOM and SVG
  P-->>W: Rendered checks passed
  W->>Z: Send delayed position 41
  W->>Z: Await history [40,41,42], then check latest 42
  Z-->>B: Updated history snapshot
  B-->>W: History receipt observation
  W->>P: Check history filled in and marker still 42
  P->>B: Inspect DOM and SVG
  P-->>W: Rendered checks passed
